        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The dominance of ionic species in precipitation was geographically differs from locations and regions are presented in Table 8. In Alibaba [Cl > Na > Mg > Ca > SO₄ > NO₃ > NH₄ > K], Goa [Cl > Na > Ca > Mg > SO₄ > NO₃ > K], and Bombay [Cl > Na > Ca > Mg > SO₄ > NO₃ > K] showed dominance of Cl (Naik et al. 2002; Parashar et al. 2001; Sequeira 1976) whereas at Colaba [Na > Cl > Ca > Mg > SO₄ > NO₃ > NH₄ > K], Silent Valley [Na > Ca > Cl > NO₃ > SO₄ > Mg > K > NH₄], Chembur [Na > Cl > Ca > NO₃ > NH₄ > Mg > SO₄ > K], there is a dominance of Na as these sites are nearer to sea coast (Naik et al. 2002; Rao et al. 1995; Khemani et al. 1994).",
          "block_bbox": [
